{"3470500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ember and Blade", "steam_appid": 3470500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember and Blade<i><strong> </strong></i>is a survivors-like adventure that blends strategic combat, elaborate boss battles, atmospheric visual design, and a dark, intricate storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a demon hunter bound to temporary immortality through an angel’s pact, you enter the realm where the archdemon Asmodeus has been sealed for centuries and encounter Ariella, the lone guardian of its seal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entangled in her tragic fate, you must carve through endless demons and face the question—can destiny itself be defied?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARVE THROUGH ENDLESS HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the immortal hunter, sweep across battlefields teeming with demons in fast-paced survivors-like action. Every swing scatters foes, every run escalates the chaos, and only your blade stands between order and oblivion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELLSENT BOSS ENCOUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Judicators of Fate—once mortals who sold their souls to become demons, now wielding immense power and devastating attacks. Only precise timing, careful strategy, and the edge of immortality can carry you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARNESS HEAVENLY BLESSINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels grant you powers beyond mortal reach. Choose between their heavenly gifts and forge evolving strategies that change with each run. Your path is never the same twice. Immortality does come with certain perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY THE CYCLE OF DEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fall is only the start of another run. Resurrection brings deeper secrets and the chance to twist fate itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERIC WORLDS AND DYNAMIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realm forged by divine fire and demonic corruption. A visually rich world awaits with balanced design, unique characters, vibrant colors, and vivid effects that bring every battle to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember and Blade<i><strong> </strong></i>is a survivors-like adventure that blends strategic combat, elaborate boss battles, atmospheric visual design, and a dark, intricate storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a demon hunter bound to temporary immortality through an angel’s pact, you enter the realm where the archdemon Asmodeus has been sealed for centuries and encounter Ariella, the lone guardian of its seal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entangled in her tragic fate, you must carve through endless demons and face the question—can destiny itself be defied?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARVE THROUGH ENDLESS HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the immortal hunter, sweep across battlefields teeming with demons in fast-paced survivors-like action. Every swing scatters foes, every run escalates the chaos, and only your blade stands between order and oblivion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELLSENT BOSS ENCOUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Judicators of Fate—once mortals who sold their souls to become demons, now wielding immense power and devastating attacks. Only precise timing, careful strategy, and the edge of immortality can carry you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/74e75338d7b4e3bbf4b299d3c5c6b381.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARNESS HEAVENLY BLESSINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels grant you powers beyond mortal reach. Choose between their heavenly gifts and forge evolving strategies that change with each run. Your path is never the same twice. Immortality does come with certain perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/32f9ad094b5977e65b3a9ed9d2eb9b4e.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY THE CYCLE OF DEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fall is only the start of another run. Resurrection brings deeper secrets and the chance to twist fate itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/a16ca3d433a61d6cdf685b7b480e3165.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERIC WORLDS AND DYNAMIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realm forged by divine fire and demonic corruption. A visually rich world awaits with balanced design, unique characters, vibrant colors, and vivid effects that bring every battle to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.poster.avif?t=1787736452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.webm?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/5c82a753b52721565cfb9670a617099d.mp4?t=1787736452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "Become the immortal hunter and stand against the archdemon Asmodeus. Cut through bullet-hell swarms, clash with Souls-like bosses, and harness celestial blessings that reshape your powers each run. The demons are rising—raise your sword.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Fans of Hades, Vampire Survivors, or roguelikes in general... absolutely deserve attention”<br>- ComicBook<br><br>“If you’re the type who breaks a sweat in Vampire Survivors, revels in Hades’ loot rush, or welcomes a “one wrong move and you’re dead” challenge, Ember and Blade’s fresh demo on Steam deserves your attention”<br>- FinalBoss<br><br>“So-called ‘survivor-like’ action-RPGs are having a heyday, and Ember and Blade seeks to add to this ever-growing pool of addictive excellence”<br>- GameRant<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/dd4c4609e5c2b77b8d6e0472d18ec2dc114caf05/header.jpg?t=1787736452", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/25bb4785cbffbbe29cd869320dd40c736383edfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787736452", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/25bb4785cbffbbe29cd869320dd40c736383edfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787736452", "website": "https://emberandblade.line.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (v2004 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 / Intel Core i3-10100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100 (4-core/8-thread or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570 / Intel Arc A380 or Radeon 680M / Intel Iris Xe (4GB VRAM required)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Targeted for 720p 30fps on Lowest settings. 16 GB RAM recommended for integrated graphics.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Targeted for 1080p 60fps on High settings (including peak monster waves).</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 (Apple Silicon only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 Pro or Apple M4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M2 Pro or Apple M4<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Targeted for 1080p 60fps.</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "<strong>© LINE Games Corporation. All rights reserved.</strong>", "developers": ["LINE Games Corporation"], "publishers": ["LINE Games Corporation"], "demos": [{"appid": 3758770, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/c95ee5bafd9e65d85f63ae75db29f12ad4340837/ss_c95ee5bafd9e65d85f63ae75db29f12ad4340837.600x338.jpg?t=1787736452", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/c95ee5bafd9e65d85f63ae75db29f12ad4340837/ss_c95ee5bafd9e65d85f63ae75db29f12ad4340837.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787736452"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/c544dd716bcd9345106e61ac355df27a94efa55a/ss_c544dd716bcd9345106e61ac355df27a94efa55a.600x338.jpg?t=1787736452", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/c544dd716bcd9345106e61ac355df27a94efa55a/ss_c544dd716bcd9345106e61ac355df27a94efa55a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787736452"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/cc759147b856122cb1a3544ca785f1d508736ff9/ss_cc759147b856122cb1a3544ca785f1d508736ff9.600x338.jpg?t=1787736452", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/cc759147b856122cb1a3544ca785f1d508736ff9/ss_cc759147b856122cb1a3544ca785f1d508736ff9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787736452"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/9da16e31dacb5bcdc37f9f3e345048c78bc053f5/ss_9da16e31dacb5bcdc37f9f3e345048c78bc053f5.600x338.jpg?t=1787736452", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/9da16e31dacb5bcdc37f9f3e345048c78bc053f5/ss_9da16e31dacb5bcdc37f9f3e345048c78bc053f5